Dear Author,

Your manuscript, twoarcs.sheaf, has been reviewed by two referees.
Neither could see the result. Nor could I.

Referee 1 recommends accept. Reviewer 2 recommends minor revision.
I see no reason to disagree with Reviewer 2.

I would be glad to see a revised version.

The reports are enclosed.

Yours sincerely,

The Editor

